        "original_id": "d3ddad3a-60d3-51f3-9c6a-80b3fc34503b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James \"Jimbo\" Mathus, Tom Maxwell, Katharine Whalen, Chris Phillips, Don Raleigh, Ken Mosher\n- Organizations: The Gaslight Anthem, Squirrel Nut Zippers, Mammoth Records\n- Places: New Brunswick, New Jersey, Chapel Hill, North Carolina\n- Products: Singles Collection: 2008–2011, Christmas Caravan\n- Topics: American rock bands, swing bands, Christmas albums, box sets\n\nFacts:\n- Squirrel Nut Zippers is an American swing band formed in 1993 in Chapel Hill, North Carolina.\n- James \"Jimbo\" Mathus, Tom Maxwell, Katharine Whalen, Chris Phillips, Don Raleigh, and Ken Mosher formed Squirrel Nut Zippers in 1993.\n- Christmas Caravan is a Christmas album by Squirrel Nut Zippers that Mammoth Records released in 1998.\n- The Gaslight Anthem is an American rock band formed in 2006 in New Brunswick, New Jersey.\n- Singles Collection: 2008–2011 is a box set by The Gaslight Anthem that was released on June 18, 2013.",
